# Pinned Ed25519 public key(s) used to verify RELEASES.json.sig before an
# update check or apply trusts anything in it.
#
# Two keys on purpose: PRIMARY is used to sign every real release; SPARE is
# an offline cold-stored key generated at the same time, never used to sign
# anything unless PRIMARY is lost. Verification accepts a signature from
# EITHER key -- so losing one copy of the private key does not brick updates
# for every already-installed host. Both live only as PEM public keys here;
# the private keys never appear in any git repo.
#
# Rotation: append the new key as a new PRIMARY/SPARE block below, keep the
# old PRIMARY block (renamed to a dated comment) until every host still
# running the old key has picked up a normally-signed update carrying the
# new pin -- removing an old key before that stops those hosts trusting
# anything.

# PRIMARY
-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----
MCowBQYDK2VwAyEAotbBY8SYxJ6lQ8k6ndbARfg/VY1gH734adLh62PEpkc=
-----END PUBLIC KEY-----

# SPARE (offline cold storage)
-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----
MCowBQYDK2VwAyEAkCLBLuzTfnRpGhqCOJMHkpRCFdiGRBD7U7rke5qwzOw=
-----END PUBLIC KEY-----
